  "description": "Kyle is a multiple X games Gold medalist in both Park and Dirt and it is his trusty Killabee frames that he has piloted to the podium each time.\n\nKyle has been with us for 10 years now and it is a pleasure to support such a talented rider and top guy.\n\nThe Killabee frame is one of our most popular frames , with its pro level geometry and design even many unsponsored Pro level riders buy it as their choice of frame to ride, check out the decks of competition Park courses and you will see many riders on a Killabee and for a reason. It is simply an absolute weapon to ride with cutting edge geometry and balance built in.\n\nMany times copied by other brands but never equalled!",
